# Batch [D]: the melodic-cowbell styles (claude/gen1-cowbell-styles.md). Their bell lines (the scale degree of each
# cowbell hit) are in gen.c, BELL_LINES. The zap plays only with the Simmons in the drum set; gen.c keeps it to the
# bars the designs give (every 4th bar, every other bar).

style BELLFUNK
kick     X... ..x. ..X. ....
snare    .... X... .... X...
clap     .... X... .... X...
chat     x.x. x.x. x.x. x.xo
cowbell  x..x ..x. x..x .x..
zap      .... .... .... ..x.

style MIAMIBELL
kick     X... ...x ..x. ....
snare    .... X... .... X...
clap     .... X... .... X...
chat     xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
cowbell  x.x. ..x. x.x. ..x.
zap      .... .... ..x. ....

style DETBELL
kick     X... X... X... X...
clap     .... X... .... X...
chat     ..o. ..o. ..o. ..o.
ohat     ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x.
cowbell  x..x ..x. x..x ..x.

style AFROBELL
kick     X..x ..x. X... .x..
snare    .... X..o .o.. X...
chat     x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x.
conga    ..x. .xx. ..x. .x.x
cowbell  x.x. xx.x .x.x x.x.
